	(text "TMAG5273A2 U4  |  Factory I2C address 0x35 (7-bit)\nSDA GPIO20 / SCL GPIO21; R15/R16 = 4.7k to 3V3; initial 100 kHz.\nA2 range option: +/-133 mT or +/-266 mT. Active current: 2.3 mA typical.\nC17: VCC pin4; TEST pin3 is GND. INT pin5 has R17 pullup only, no MCU IRQ.\nFirmware: INT_MODE = 0; use I2C trigger / status or timed acquisition." (at 18 20 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b808684-f79e-5e60-ab3e-b1099484a2a6"))
)
